<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Monday's spot rupee rates in kerb market from two leading exchange dealers:</p>
<p>			 Kalia &amp; Khanani Int'l   ARY Int'l Exchange</p>
<p> U.S. dollar	 41.95/42.00		 41.90/41.95</p>
<p> Pound sterling    69.55/69.65		 69.40/69.60</p>
<p> Deutsche mark     27.00/27.05		 26.90/27.00</p>
